# Configuration

Read `docs/technical/infra/configuration.md` for full detail. Apply these rules when editing `appsettings*.json`, `infra/secrets/*`, `infra/configuration/*`, `infra/docker/*`, `docker-compose.yml`, `infra/dev/*`, or frontend runtime config.

## Local estate (primary)

- Primary path: **native** — SQL Server + Azurite on the host; Auth0 tenant via `infra/secrets/api.env`.
- Orchestration: `npm run doctor` → `npm run start` / `stop` / `status` ([`infra/dev/`](infra/dev/)).
- Ports are fixed (`44100` API, `44200` web via SWA, `44300` app via SWA, `44400` functions, Azurite `10000–10002`; Angular `ng serve` on `4200`/`4201` behind SWA).
- Do **not** auto-install npm/dotnet packages on start; each project owns its deps for now.

## Checked-in values

- **Default to local-working settings** in source control only when they are true for all consumers (Azurite endpoints, fixed local callback ports). Secrets **and** per-developer/tenant values (SQL connection, SPA Auth0 client IDs) belong in `infra/secrets/api.env` — empty placeholders beat wrong defaults.
- **Placeholders** for secrets in `appsettings.json` (e.g. `[located in user secrets | keyvault]`).

## Secrets and data

- **Secrets:** [`infra/secrets/`](infra/secrets/) — gitignored files beside `*.example` (e.g. `api.env` / `api.env.example`). Hosted Key Vault values: gitignored `infra/configuration/kv-secrets.<environment>.json` beside `*.example`. Not under `infra/docker/`.
- **Local overlay:** when `AZURE_APP_CONFIG` is unset, inject `infra/secrets/api.env` into the process environment before start (`.NET` default precedence), **or** use .NET user secrets when debugging the API in Visual Studio (same keys, `:` form — set manually). When App Config is set, App Configuration + Key Vault only.
- **Data:** [`infra/data/`](infra/data/) (e.g. Azurite). Compose and native share this path name. Deeper sharing is [issue 128](https://github.com/dertinfo/dertinfo-mono/issues/128).
- **Do not duplicate non-secrets** in secrets files if already in `appsettings.json`.

## Azure vs local

- **`AZURE_APP_CONFIG` unset** → `appsettings.json` + process env from `infra/secrets/api.env` (via `npm run start` / Compose).
- **`AZURE_APP_CONFIG` set** (test/production) → App Configuration + Key Vault; do not hardcode hosted values in the repo.
